<title>ROMANIA: ROMANIA - WEATHER - OCT 30 - NOV 2.</title>
<headline>ROMANIA - WEATHER - OCT 30 - NOV 2.</headline>
<text>
<p>WEDNESDAY</p>
<p>- Cloudy in the western, central and northern regions with rainfalls. Clouds and rain areas later extend to the south and east. Colder in the northwest, with slightly higher temperatures in the south. Temp. 8 to 18 C.</p>
<p>THURSDAY, FRIDAY, SATURDAY</p>
<p>- Colder, with clearer skies. Rainfalls only in the north. Weather tends to warm towards weekend, with minimum temperatures rising from -4 to 0 centigrades. Temp. 0 to 16 C. (Source: National Meteorological Institute)</p>
